<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Command upgrades Ravva oil field.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Command upgrades Ravva oil field.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Command Petroleum Ltd said it has revised up the reserves in the Ravva oil field offshore India by 34.3 million barrels of oil equivalent (BOE) or 22 percent to 189.3 million BOE of which 89 percent is oil.</p>
<p>Command said the upgrade was after the completion of an in-house analysis of the oil and gas reserves at Ravva.</p>
<p>&quot;The reserve upgrade is largely due to the joint venture's recent development drilling activity and, therefore, the additional reserves will be developed and produced for little or no extra cost,&quot; Command said.</p>
</text>
